# Engineering Wiki — Schema & Operating Rules

This file is auto-loaded by Claude Code whenever an agent works inside `docs/wiki/`. It is the schema layer of a Karpathy-style second brain. Read order, hard rules, and folder map all live here.

The wiki has two halves:

- `sources/` — **append-only**, immutable. Populated by the project's TDD orchestrator (e.g. `triad.md` Phase 8.5 archives cycle reports here) and by owner-decision capture.
- `wiki/` — curated by `@wiki-curator` under two-pass HITL discipline. Per-cycle distillation (Mode A) and end-of-sprint compilation (Mode B).

Do not confuse them.

## Folder map

